\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Over C, do the arithmetic matrix-multiplication exponents satisfy $\omega <2.258$, the dual rectangular exponent $\alpha >0.465$, and $w(0.709)<2.092$, using exact arithmetic operations?

\subsection{Short English statement}
Over C, do the arithmetic matrix-multiplication exponents satisfy $\omega <2.258$, the dual rectangular exponent $\alpha >0.465$, and $w(0.709)<2.092$, using exact arithmetic operations?

\subsection{Sources}
